&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204356595 BCX8&quot;&gt;Solution Architect - Ma&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204356595 BCX8&quot;&gt;nage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204356595 BCX8&quot;&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204356595 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW204356595 BCX8&quot;&gt;(Emerging Innovation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media Solutions: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW29668349 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW29668349 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;At WPP Media Solutions, we are at the forefront of shaping the future of media. Our clients, leading global brands, demand integrated, impactful, and measurable media strategies that directly contribute to their business results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW29668349 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW29668349 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Leveraging our proprietary data, technology, and media partnerships, we create single points of access to addressable media, offering advanced solutions that drive meaningful results with greater efficiency and precision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW29668349 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;This is a pivotal role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at WPP Media Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;, blending strategic vision with practical execution to drive continuous improvement, growth, innovation, and competitive differentiation. This individual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;designing, testing, and globally rolling out&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;new solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;, thereby providing clients with access to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;new technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;, data, audiences, and advanced measurement and attribution capabilities. Th&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;role ensures a consistent vision and architecture, offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;ing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW217934101 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;best practice guidance on implementation, and continuously evaluates the success of these solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our global solution leads and local teams on designing, testing and implementation of new measurement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with our partners and vendors on a technical level to architect solutions, drive solution development and develop joint roadmaps, where required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the scale and sophistication of data &amp;amp; measurement solution adoption by clients and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert in both commercial and technical contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain complex technical concepts to non technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Global WPP Media Solution&#39;s interests in relevant cross-functional WPP Media initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design testing frameworks and guide ‘proof of concept’ market tests to drive iterative development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and help test partnership opportunities across inventory, data and technology to support the successful development of new measurement solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input into business cases for new solutions to help illustrate their value and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the research and assessment of new solutions and track and evaluate their success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input into the go-to-market strategy, positioning, marketing and training materials for new solutions, working closely with the global solution leads and market development teams within existing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to and help drive a culture of innovation across our global organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
